# Unity .gitignore for the repo layout:  <repo root>/CoOpTest  (Unity project)
# All Unity paths are prefixed with CoOpTest/ because the project is a subfolder of the repo.

# --- Unity generated folders ---
CoOpTest/[Ll]ibrary/
CoOpTest/[Tt]emp/
CoOpTest/[Oo]bj/
CoOpTest/[Bb]uild/
CoOpTest/[Bb]uilds/
CoOpTest/[Ll]ogs/
CoOpTest/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
CoOpTest/[Mm]emory[Cc]aptures/
CoOpTest/[Rr]ecordings/
CoOpTest/ProfilerCaptures/
CoOpTest/TestResults/

# Never ignore .meta files inside Assets/Packages (embedded package) - GUIDs must be shared
# (nothing above ignores them; this is just a note)

# --- Build output / crash / debug artifacts ---
*_BurstDebugInformation_DoNotShip/
*_BackUpThisFolder_ButDontShipItWithYourGame/
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.unitypackage.meta
*.app
CoOpTest/sysinfo.txt
CoOpTest/crashlytics-build.properties
CoOpTest/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
CoOpTest/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

# --- Autogenerated IDE project files (Unity regenerates these) ---
CoOpTest/*.csproj
CoOpTest/*.unityproj
CoOpTest/*.sln
CoOpTest/*.slnx
CoOpTest/*.suo
CoOpTest/*.user
CoOpTest/*.userprefs
CoOpTest/*.pidb
CoOpTest/*.booproj
CoOpTest/*.svd
CoOpTest/*.pdb
CoOpTest/*.pdb.meta
CoOpTest/*.mdb
CoOpTest/*.mdb.meta

# --- Unity Package Manager: keep manifest + lock + embedded packages, ignore nothing else here ---
# (CoOpTest/Packages/manifest.json, packages-lock.json and com.rlabrecque.steamworks.net/ are tracked)

# --- IDEs / editors ---
.vs/
.idea/
.gradle/
.consulo/
.history/
*.vsix
# VS Code: keep shared config only
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
CoOpTest/.vscode/*
!CoOpTest/.vscode/settings.json
!CoOpTest/.vscode/tasks.json
!CoOpTest/.vscode/launch.json
!CoOpTest/.vscode/extensions.json

# --- Local secrets / env ---
.env
.env.*

# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# --- Misc temp ---
*.tmp
*.log.lock
